sequenceDiagram
    actor Scheduler as User (Crew Scheduler)
    participant WebApp as Web app
    participant Backend
    participant Database
    Scheduler->>WebApp: Upload CSV or Excel
    WebApp->>Backend: Validate file and rows
    break Invalid file
        Backend-->>WebApp: Validation errors
        WebApp-->>Scheduler: Correct the source and re-upload
    end
    Backend->>Database: Save preview and captured rule version
    Backend-->>WebApp: Validated preview
    WebApp-->>Scheduler: Review roster and rules
    Scheduler->>WebApp: Run check
    WebApp->>Backend: Check saved preview
    Backend->>Database: Load roster and captured rules
    Backend->>Backend: Apply captured rules
    Backend->>Database: Save immutable result and applied rules
    Backend-->>WebApp: Saved findings
    WebApp-->>Scheduler: Review flags and evidence
